+rows keep a consistent inset; workspace titles and worktree connectors remain
+aligned with titles that have no preceding metrics. Group-collapse controls stay
+on the workspace title row rather than the first metric row. Layouts without a
+`workspace` token retain their first-row indentation behavior.
